  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Add PDSection collapsible section component (fixes #30): smooth CSS grid animation, accessible markup, two-way bindable IsCollapsed, TitleTemplate and HeaderActions slots, HeadingLevel support, IsDisabled parameter, ExpandAsync/CollapseAsync/ToggleAsync API, borderless/flush variants, fully themeable via --pd-section-* CSS custom properties.\n      - Fix PDTable selected row highlight: target td cells, use Bootstrap CSS variables, protect inputs and .text-danger from forced white text.\n      - Expand PDFileModal demo with labelled examples: await-result, event-callback, custom button text/icons, excluded paths, read-only indicator, and extra-large size.\n      - Fix PDModal close button Bootstrap 4 to 5 markup and remove focus outline; expand demo page with size, centred, custom buttons, await result and ESC-disabled examples.\n      - Fix PDModal CloseOnEscape and HideOnBackgroundClick by using camelCase Bootstrap modal options (#32).\n      - Fix PDTree drag ghost image for custom NodeTemplate (#38).",
